{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","罗万"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名机智的辅助，能为友军提供大量的能量和生命值回复。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有人要买药水吗？买四送一了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Potions for sale! Buy four, get one free!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","每枚硬币都花在了刀刃上。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Every coin was wisely spent."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","不要慌张，送货上门！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Don't worry, your delivery's coming up!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","这就是破产吗……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Feels... like I just lost all my money..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","感谢惠顾，今天全场八折！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Pleasure doing business with ya. Here's a discount!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","欢迎光临，要点什么？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","金额，出货，盈利周期，还差什么？对了，要给客户带赠品！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","正面是赚钱，背面就是赚更多！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","稍微休息一下，来布拉达科医师，往这儿飞，太棒了，你是最厉害的小鸟。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这是耀光最流行的商品！看来你也很有商业头脑！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","这是合作的赠品吗？哈哈，多谢！"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","旅行商人"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","为了拓展事业版图，未来的商业巨子踏上旅途。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","秘银之子"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","商业帝国的继承人满载而归。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","赛季手册里程碑达到指定积分获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要来点什么？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","之后的商业计划……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","先喝点饮品吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这些彩带都是特别定制的！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","隆冬节礼物送什么好呢？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这些灯笼造价多少呢？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","颜色很有氛围啊"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","根据雷格尼茨家的家仆回忆，罗万少爷出生时，有钱币掉落的叮当声，经久不息。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","王都一度很流行罗万经手过的物品，据说能带来财运，其中最畅销的就是他从小伙伴那里收购的画作。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","曾有人向罗万推销自己的商品，达成交易后却发现自己买的更多。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","\"几年的账册，他几小时就核对完了，不愧是首富之子，秘银商会的继承人啊！\"——某位破产后全部资产被罗万收购的合作伙伴。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","见过维拉夫人以后，罗万曾经尝试着让姝鸳学习说话，但是它就是蹦不出一个字，只会嘎嘎大笑。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","罗万很少参加各路贵族子女的社交活动，相反的，各类商业集会中却总能看到他的身影。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","曾经有座村庄爆发了饥荒，罗万不仅拒绝了与当地商人一起囤积居奇，反而凭借自己的手段压低了生活必需品的平均价格。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","“罗万那个小少爷，老是追在我后面，一副愧疚的样子说想补偿我，甩都甩不掉，真拿他没办法。”——米瑞尔"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","罗万经常出入秘银商会分会，对麾下的商人发布指令。对于利用家族势力这一点，他毫不避讳。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","罗万的篷车是父亲遗留下来的老古董，价格在拍卖行被炒得很高，但他用起来毫不手软。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","秘银商会对学院存在的商业投资可能性进行了详尽的评估，我十分看好其中一个项目。"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep6/herohub_story/16411030.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","罗万"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","金币、商业计划书、布拉达克一世的特供粮……这包真是越来越沉了。"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep6/herohub_story/16411060.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","罗万"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","我个人最偏爱的，是“魔法烤肉”。用火焰魔法把肉汁牢牢锁在里面，一口咬下去，满嘴都是热腾腾的鲜甜，光是想想就让人欲罢不能。"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep6/herohub_story/16411210.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","罗万"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","上一次跟佩吉吵架，就是升华庆典开始前的事……"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411050.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","罗万"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","这些就是最新一批的顾客意见反馈啊，我看看……"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411070.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","罗万"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","佩吉，你回来了！"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411100.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","罗万 & 佩吉"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","佩吉，给你看这个！"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep7/herohub_story/17411120.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","罗万 & 佩吉"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","罗万，你没事吧？"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10411030.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 罗万"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","金穗村的季度粮食产量，确认。\n综合收购方案第三款，确认。\n金穗村及格罗登平原全域道路保障及维护，确认。"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415022.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","罗万 & 维伦"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","要来点什么？"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415050.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","罗万"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","先喝点饮品吧"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415051.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","罗万"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","这些彩带都是特别定制的！"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415351.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","罗万"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","隆冬节礼物送什么好呢？"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415352.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","罗万"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/cn","你们这里的布置……很有设计感啊。"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415509.json"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/cn","